    <!--
        Add onDelete/onUpdate rules to ALL existing foreign keys for proper referential integrity.
        
        Strategy:
        - CASCADE: Child records (order_item, bill_item, etc.) deleted with parent
        - RESTRICT: Reference data (cannot delete if referenced)
        - SET NULL: Optional relationships (nullable FKs)
